WEBVTT

00:04:57.359 --> 00:05:01.579
who has been a particularly effective altruist

00:05:01.579 --> 00:05:03.496
because he got this.

00:05:03.496 --> 00:05:06.775
This is the website of the Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation,

00:05:06.775 --> 00:05:10.571
and if you look at the words on the top right-hand side,

00:05:10.571 --> 00:05:14.498
it says, "All lives have equal value."

00:05:14.498 --> 00:05:16.367
That's the understanding,

00:05:16.367 --> 00:05:19.989
the rational understanding of our situation in the world

00:05:19.989 --> 00:05:22.250
that has led to these people

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:26.931
being the most effective altruists in history,

00:05:26.931 --> 00:05:29.603
Bill and Melinda Gates and Warren Buffett.

00:05:29.603 --> 00:05:35.736
(Applause)